      "content": "{\"analogy\":null,\"claim\":\"Replace the existing platform entirely with a purpose-built immutable ledger that enforces replication as a precondition for entry, eliminating the need for a separate validation layer by baking epistemic rigor into the storage mechanism itself.\",\"counterconditions\":[{\"case\":\"The cost of migrating historical data to the new immutable ledger exceeds the project budget.\",\"checker_spec\":null,\"eval\":\"observation\"},{\"case\":\"The latency of consensus mechanisms prevents real-time iteration required for rapid prototyping.\",\"checker_spec\":null,\"eval\":\"observation\"},{\"case\":\"The domain requires mutable corrections that an immutable ledger structurally forbids.\",\"checker_spec\":null,\"eval\":\"observation\"}],\"definitions\":[],\"derivation\":[],\"formalization_refs\":[],\"mechanism\":\"Constitutive Epistemic Architecture: Replaces flexible tools with rigid infrastructure where acceptance is impossible without prior independent verification, shifting the causal link from post-hoc filtering to pre-entry gating (SRC_003).\",\"premises\":[],\"schema\":\"deepreason-reasoning-envelope-v1\",\"scope\":{\"covers\":[\"new-data-ingestion\"],\"excludes\":[\"legacy-data-migration\"]},\"simulation_refs\":[],\"uncertainties\":[]}"
